From 4ba23949bf1124ad053bd1f01f5d69f299a535e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:59:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 141/143] Patch 0141: the length of a gym session and of one
 step of it as MOD_TRAIN_RULES / MOD_TRAIN2_RULES slots (60 s and 6 s in the
 original), in the 14 places of the TRN and TRN2 overlays that counted 0x4b0
 and 120

